5. NOTEBOOK
   ↓ POST http://inference-api:8000/generate_masks
      multipart/form-data: dicom_file=... top_n=3

6. INFERENCE API (inference-api container)
   ↓ preprocess_dicom()
   ↓ model_predict()
   ↓ generate_gradcam()
   ← JSON response

7. NOTEBOOK
   ↓ Decode base64 images
   ↓ plt.imshow(...)
   → Display to user
```

### Acesso Externo

**Host machine → Containers:**

```bash
# Acessar Orthanc UI
open http://localhost:8042

# Testar API
curl http://localhost:8000/health

# Jupyter
open http://localhost:8888
```

**Port mapping (docker-compose.yml):**
```yaml
orthanc:
  ports: ["8042:8042"]  # host:container

inference-api:
  ports: ["8000:8000"]

jupyter:
  ports: ["8888:8888"]
```

